          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is the return policy for Fitness Superstore?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Fitness Superstore allows <strong>returns within 14 days from the time you received the product</strong>. To be eligible for a refund, you must contact us within 14 days and be prepared with your proof of purchase, order number, delivery date, and the reason for the return.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "disable_accordion": false,
            "open_collapsible_row": true
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_LGKj44": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What condition must returned products be in?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Returned products must be in their original condition, with original packaging and tags attached. Stickers on the product or packaging should remain intact. Fitness Superstore does not accept returns on items damaged by abuse, misuse, or obtained from unauthorized sources.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "disable_accordion": false,
            "open_collapsible_row": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_LAiiCP": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Should original packaging be kept for returns?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>To qualify for returns, Fitness Superstore requires that the original packaging is retained. The product should be in its exact original state, with tags and stickers still intact. Alterations or removal of packaging labels will make the return ineligible.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "disable_accordion": false,
            "open_collapsible_row": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_wRbU79": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Who pays the return shipping cost if an order is cancelled after dispatch?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Return shipping is at your expense. Customers must prepay and insure the return shipping charges. Refunds exclude shipping costs, and if shipping was free, the actual shipping cost will be deducted from your refund.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "disable_accordion": false,
            "open_collapsible_row": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_fkexRU": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How should goods be packed and returned to Fitness Superstore?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Products must be packed in their original packaging, with all tags and stickers intact. The product should be in new condition and free from any damage. If the packaging is altered or damaged, the return may not be accepted. Fitness Superstore reserves the right to inspect and verify that the product was returned in its original condition.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "disable_accordion": false,
            "open_collapsible_row": false
          }
        }
