            "text": "<p>In order to be eligible for a refund, you should promptly Contact Us <strong>within 14 days</strong> from the time you received the Product (“<strong>Return Period</strong>”) with information about the Product such as proof of purchase, order number, date of purchase, delivery date, and the reason for the return</p>",
